Thunderstorm Warning issued August 29 at 12:13AM CDT until August 29 at 1:00AM CDT by NWS Aberdeen SD","description":"SVRABR\n\nThe National Weather Service in Aberdeen has issued a\n\n* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...\nWest Central Clark County in northeastern South Dakota...\nSoutheastern Spink County in northeastern South Dakota...\n\n* Until 100 AM CDT.\n\n* At 1213 AM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located over Glendale\nColony, or 15 miles east of Redfield, moving northeast at 25 mph.\n\nHAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and half dollar size hail.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Hail damage to vehicles is expected. Expect wind damage to\nroofs, siding, and trees.\n\n* This severe thunderstorm will be near...\nGlendale Colony, Spink Colony and Frankfort around 1215 AM CDT.\nCamrose Colony around 1225 AM CDT.\nHillside Colony around 1230 AM CDT.\nDoland around 1235 AM CDT.\nClark Colony around 1240 AM CDT.","instruction":"Seek shelter inside a well-built structure and stay away from\nwindows. This storm is capable of producing damaging winds and large\nhail.\n\nReport severe weather to your nearest law enforcement agency or the\nNational Weather Service office in Aberdeen SD.","response":"Shelter","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["SVRABR"],"WMOidentifier":["WUUS53 KABR 290513"],"eventMotionDescription":["2026-08-29T05:13:00-00:00...storm...247DEG...20KT...44.8,-98.24"],"windThreat":["RADAR INDICATED"],"maxWindGust":["60 MPH"],"hailThreat":["RADAR INDICATED"],"maxHailSize":["1.25"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.NEW.KABR.SV.W.0239.260829T0513Z-260829T0600Z/"],"eventEndingTime":["2026-08-29T01:00:00-05:00"]},"scope":"Public","code":"IPAWSv1.0","language":"en-US","web":"http://www.weather.gov","eventCode":{"SAME":["SVR"],"NationalWeatherService":["SVW"]}}},{"id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.e9ba0ec6ecbecaa3845f0aa14c666df5cd00b58b.001.1","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coo